A
Implement RBAC in Azure Databricks at multiple levels:
Workspace roles: Assign Admin, User, or Viewer roles to control who can create clusters, jobs, and notebooks
Cluster policies: Define policies restricting VM types, max nodes, and auto-termination to enforce cost control per team
Data access via Unity Catalog: Centralize permissions on catalogs, schemas, and tables with GRANT / REVOKE statements
AAD integration: Map Azure Active Directory groups to Databricks groups for consistent, centralized identity management
